config BR2_PACKAGE_OPEN8030_PROFILES
	bool "open8030-profiles"
	help
	  Open8030's board profiles for the Ascent Lite/Lite+ and the VRX
	  Pro (register defaults, pin records, frame-control-header keys,
	  flash parts), reverse engineered from Caddx's stock radio
	  firmware, and the goggle radio's Open8030 configuration: what
	  the open8030 package builds the radio firmware with. Nothing is
	  installed on the target.
